WEBVTT

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:11.599
Choose Theme in the side menu.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:20.556
Scroll to Colours to
see the colour ratios.

00:00:25.255 --> 00:00:31.255
Click Theme history.

00:00:32.873 --> 00:00:38.873
Check the Theme history list.

00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:47.696
Click Back to theme.

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:55.348
Scroll to Reset to default at the top.
